data: {"id": "8a7d54c7c0df4589-thinking-parallel_evidence-922", "run_id": "8a7d54c7c0df4589", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 baseline 结果，Metrics 确认了 `waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` 且 `phase=Pending`，而 Logging 和 Tracing 因容器未启动/pod_ip 为空返回 empty。这符合 ContainerCreating 阶段的预期。\n\n现在执行 **Kubernetes 实时验证**，通过 `describe` 和 `yaml` 定位具体停滞原因（是镜像拉取、卷挂载、还是沙箱创建失败）。\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 实时证据采集\n\n**目的**: 确认 `ContainerCreating` 停滞的直接原因。获取 Pod 详细事件和 Spec 配置。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789118353206, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

