lumes:\n  input:\n    Type:        Secret (a volume populated by a Secret)\n    SecretName:  unavailable-input\n    Optional:    false\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedMount  96s (x15 over 15m)  kubelet            MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found\n  Warning  FailedMount  18s (x7 over 13m)   kubelet            Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8a7d54c7c0df4589-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8a7d54c7c0df4589-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8a7d54c7c0df4589-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

