data: {"id": "8a7d54c7c0df4589-final", "run_id": "8a7d54c7c0df4589", "seq": 1354, "ts_ms": 1789118374734, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v04/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload (aiops-case-v04) stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending with FailedMount errors |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 96s (x15 over 15m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found` | 核心病因：明确指出了挂载卷 `input` 时因找不到 Secret `unavailable-input` 而失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount 18s (x7 over 13m) kubelet Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]...` | 持续复现：进一步佐证 `input` 卷的挂载失败是当前持续存在的阻塞状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Waiting Reason: ContainerCreating`; `Phase: Pending` | 症状确认：容器卡在初始化前的挂载阶段，未进入运行状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 指标印证：Prometheus 侧观测到容器确实处于等待挂载的状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container \"app\" resources: cpu_request=5m, memory_request=8Mi, cpu_limit=50m, memory_limit=32Mi` | 排除资源：资源请求/限制极小，排除了因资源不足导致调度和启动阻塞的可能性 |\n\n**证据关联：**\nK8s 事件（#1, #2）与 Pod 状态（#3）直接关联，指出了阻塞点在“挂载卷”而非“启动容器”。指标（#4）从观测侧证实了这一“等待”状态。配置（#5）排除了资源瓶颈，反向聚焦于依赖资源（Secret）缺失的问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nNamespace 'aiops-case-v04' 中缺少 Secret 'unavailable-input' → Kubelet 无法挂载 Pod 定义的 'input' 卷 → 容器沙箱初始化失败 → Pod 长期处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **缺失 Kubernetes Secret**。\n\nPod 的卷配置引用了名为 `input` 的 Secret，但该 Secret 在 `aiops-case-v04` 命名空间中不存在。这导致 kubelet 在尝试挂载该卷时持续报错（证据 #1, #2），进而阻止了容器沙箱的创建和初始化（证据 #3）。Prometheus 指标（证据 #4）一致反映了该等待状态。\n\n*证据支持：#1, #2, #3, #4*\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v04/workload: 35.4s (Evidence 29.5s, RCA 5.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v04/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 71.262, "metrics": {"run_id": "8a7d54c7c0df4589", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 71.26709723472595, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 71267.09723472595, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 68047.41430282593, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "